* Review the summaries of previous attempts that are already provided
* If you need more details about a specific attempt, use browse_attempt with an attempt ID to see its full trajectory
* Analyze what worked, what didn't, and why
* Synthesize insights from multiple attempts
* Create a detailed plan for what should be done next
